        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\int\\frac{dx}{1+{e}^{x}}$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix} & \\int\\frac{dx}{1+{e}^{x}}=\\int\\frac{{e}^{-x}dx}{{e}^{-x}+1} \\text{ ধরি, }{e}^{-x}+1=z\\\\ & =\\int\\frac{-dz}{z}\\\\ & ∴-{e}^{-x}dx=dz\\\\ & =-\\lnZ+c\\\\ & =-\\ln({e}^{-x}+1)+c\\text{ (Ans.) }\\\\ & \\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্প-১ হতে নির্ণয় কর : (i) ${\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{1+g(\\theta)}d\\theta$ ;\n${\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}f(\\theta)\\sqrt[3]{g(\\theta)}d\\theta$"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "(i) $\\begin{matrix} & {\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{1+g(\\theta)}d\\theta\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{1+\\sin\\theta}d\\theta\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{{\\sin}^{2}\\frac{\\theta}{2}+{\\cos}^{2}\\frac{\\theta}{2}+2\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}\\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}}\\text{ }d\\theta\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{{(\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}+\\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2})}^{2}}\\text{ }d\\theta\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}(\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}+\\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2})d\\theta\\\\ & ={-\\frac{\\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}}+\\frac{\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}}]}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\\\ & =-2\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\cos0-2\\sin0\\\\ & =-2\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}+2\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}+2-0\\\\ & =2(\\text{ Ans. })\\end{matrix}$\nধরি, $z=\\sin\\theta$\n$∴dz=\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\n[IMG_0]\n$\\begin{matrix} & \\text{ (ii) }{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}f(\\theta)\\sqrt[3]{g(\\theta)}d\\theta\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}{\\cos}^{3}\\theta\\sqrt[3]{\\sin\\theta}d\\theta\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}(1-{\\sin}^{2}\\theta)\\sqrt[3]{\\sin\\theta}\\cdot\\cos\\thetad\\theta\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{1}(1-{z}^{2}){z}^{\\frac{1}{3}}dz\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{1}({z}^{\\frac{1}{3}}-{z}^{\\frac{7}{3}})dz\\end{matrix}$\n$\\begin{matrix} & ={[\\frac{{z}^{\\frac{1}{3}+1}}{\\frac{1}{3}+1}-\\frac{{z}^{\\frac{7}{3}}+1}{\\frac{7}{3}+1}]}_{0}^{1}\\\\ & ={[\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot{z}^{\\frac{4}{3}}-\\frac{3}{10}{z}^{\\frac{10}{3}}]}_{0}^{1}\\\\ & =\\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{3}{10}-0+0\\\\ & =\\frac{15-6}{20}=\\frac{9}{20}\\text{ (Ans.) }\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্প-২ এর আলোকে বৃত্তটি দ্বারা আবদ্ধক্ষেত্রের ক্ষেত্রফল সমাকলন পদ্ধতিতে নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "[IMG_0]\nনির্ণেয় ক্ষেত্রফল $=4\\times(y=\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}},x$ অক্ষ এবং কোটি $x=0$ ও $x=6$ দ্বারা আবদ্ধ ক্ষুত্রের ক্ষেত্রফল)\nধরি, $x=6\\sin\\theta$\n$∴dx=6\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\nএবং $\\theta={\\sin}^{-1}\\frac{x}{6}$\n$\\begin{matrix} & =4{\\int}_{0}^{6}ydx\\\\ & =4{\\int}_{0}^{6}\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}}dx\\\\ & =4{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{36-36{\\sin}^{2}\\theta}\\cdot6\\cos\\thetad\\theta\\\\ & =144{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{{\\cos}^{2}\\theta}\\cos\\thetad\\theta\\\\ & =144{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}{\\cos}^{2}\\thetad\\theta\\\\ & =72{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}2{\\cos}^{2}\\thetad\\theta\\\\ & =72{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}(1+\\cos2\\theta)d\\theta\\\\ & =72{[\\theta+\\frac{1}{2}\\sin2\\theta]}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\\\ & =72[\\frac{\\pi}{2}+0-0]\\end{matrix}$\n$=36\\pi$ বগ একক। (Ans.)"
          }
        }
